# THE WRITE (spec 2.6, the GearSigil.apply order): Object[] { Integer code (1 done, 0 refused - nothing moved, -1 failed - see the message),
# String message, IS the new item, BD its document }. The augment(s) leave first (inventory stacks - never the item's own slot -, then the bags
# through sacks:fn:take), then the item's own slot gets the new document; any failure puts everything back; AUG-BEGIN is on disk before anything
